      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They cant really outright ban clients because they are essentially mimicking the vrchat client, thats how they work. The ones that were getting banned were doing things that vrchat doesnt normally do and I assume that is how they detected it. Clients will never be fully preventable. But if they want to reduce the likely hood of people making them allowing modding is probably the best way. As well as doing server side verification of user actions to make sure they arent trying to exploit things.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
