      "value": "Better to just ask for more communication and back and forth between the community and staff than anything else. That's the root cause of this issue and again why these \"positive\" modifications to the original client occured in the first place as people got disillusioned and felt the heavy disconnect from staff and the userbase. (I love you staff and offer my fealty and utmost respect. These client scum should be permanently erased from the metaverse for even creating this situation. Absolutely disgraceful.)",
