      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i believe mods is a nice idea for vrchat. but vrchat is just not secure enough to just let anyone use mods. why do you think they say it is ban-able for the use of any modification of the client? vrchat is way to unstable and not secure enough for this kind of implementation. they just added quest. which was a bad idea because there game is already unstable enough. now they have to add support for pc and vr and quest. don't get me wrong. i think it is always a good idea to add cross platform to games. but they added it way to soon.",
